{"data":[{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109952103968059392","3_2109952138571108353","3_2109952171290849280","3_2109952220842401792"]},"author_id":"1103946421882011648","created_at":"2026-10-13T10:20:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109952284129972613"],"id":"2109952284129972613","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":14,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"🔐 Cyber Safety &amp; Security Awareness Programme at PM SHRI KV Karimganj in collaboration with Assam Police, Sribhumi Branch. Sh. K. Lamnganbi Singha, APS, DySP, and Sh. Sudarshan Das, SI, sensitised students of Classes VIII &amp; IX on digital arrest scams,safe internet practices. 🛡️ https://t.co/mWsVaQypKk","url":"https://x.com/kvkarimganj/status/2109952284129972613"},{"author_id":"14891103","created_at":"2026-10-13T09:49:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109944710987133314"],"id":"2109944710987133314","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":9,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Park Street er ki obostha!\n\nMy cabbie is lamenting, pujor shomoi kothao gari park kora jabe na. Park Street restaurants and businesses will suffer. Lanes choto hoye gyechhe. Traffic is already a nightmare.\n\nStraitjacketed like Sribhumi during Pujo.","url":"https://x.com/TopSR/status/2109944710987133314"},{"author_id":"1720665183188922368","created_at":"2026-10-13T09:40:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109942245214335171"],"id":"2109942245214335171","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":14,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@IndianGeostrat Famous Kolkata Durga Puja pandals &amp; nearest metro:\n\nKumartuli Park - Shobhabazar Sutanuti\nBagbazar Sarbojanin - Shobhabazar Sutanuti\nSovabazar Rajbari - Shobhabazar Sutanuti\nAhiritola Sarbojanin - Shobhabazar Sutanuti\nCollege Square - Central\nSantosh Mitra Square - Central","url":"https://x.com/grok/status/2109942245214335171"},{"author_id":"37407255","created_at":"2026-10-13T09:13:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109935488618647809"],"id":"2109935488618647809","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":308,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":2},"text":"The chairman of Tala Prattoy Durga Puja is MLA Ritesh Tiwari https://t.co/ZiblCgwfmg","url":"https://x.com/Aagan86/status/2109935488618647809"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109931907232432128"]},"author_id":"2016241079939694593","created_at":"2026-10-13T08:59:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109931913867903001"],"id":"2109931913867903001","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1199,"like_count":71,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":13},"text":"🚨Union Home Minister Amit Shah to Arrive in Kolkata on Maha Saptami for 2-Day Durga Puja Visit:\n\nUnion Home Minister Amit Shah is scheduled to arrive in West Bengal on a two-day festive tour starting Saturday, October 17 (Maha Saptami), continuing his tradition of joining https://t.co/LoyCXRxZ4V","url":"https://x.com/Banglar_Tintin/status/2109931913867903001"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2109931335896948736"]},"author_id":"1341576373672898561","created_at":"2026-10-13T08:57:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109931403039416650"],"id":"2109931403039416650","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":19,"impression_count":10917,"like_count":573,"quote_count":10,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":81},"text":"Massive Police &amp; Central Forces deployed at Rajabazar-Park Circus. The CJP-Left &amp; Mamata Banerjee gang is trying to disrupt Durga Puja in the City with Politics. https://t.co/n5PfnqU80W","url":"https://x.com/SudhanidhiB/status/2109931403039416650"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2109927056658276352"]},"author_id":"2086642811173253120","created_at":"2026-10-13T08:40:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109927357700333738"],"id":"2109927357700333738","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":0,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"🚨 কলকাতার টালা প্রত্যয় দুর্গাপুজোর উদ্বোধন করলেন মুখ্যমন্ত্রী শুভেন্দু অধিকারী\n\n📝 টালা প্রত্যয় দুর্গাপুজোর উদ্বোধনী অনুষ্ঠানে উপস্থিত মুখ্যমন্ত্রী শুভেন্দু অধিকারী।\n\n🔖#টালা_প্রত্যয় #শুভেন্দু_অধিকারী #DurgaPuja https://t.co/sd7C1JwLAz","url":"https://x.com/newsbanglalive4/status/2109927357700333738"},{"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-13T08:34:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109925700232954187"],"id":"2109925700232954187","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":206,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"text":"I cover 95% of the good ones (including all the big clubs and/or newly famous clubs).\n\nThere are many more like me.\n\nYou just have to be precise in your schedule, know your route, be prepared to walk 15-25km everyday, and have a lot of patience. https://t.co/u6FfNNXAmp","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109925700232954187"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109923167867441152"]},"author_id":"1341576373672898561","created_at":"2026-10-13T08:24:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109923185835864264"],"id":"2109923185835864264","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":2418,"like_count":495,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":26},"text":"The Divine Queen at Howrah\nSwamiji Sporting. (Pic: Pritam Das) https://t.co/AZAOJtbpBG","url":"https://x.com/SudhanidhiB/status/2109923185835864264"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2109919624959791105"]},"author_id":"1348626540657983488","created_at":"2026-10-13T08:22:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109922753038229810"],"id":"2109922753038229810","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":192,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"দুর্গোত্‍সবে বাংলায় আসছেন অমিত শাহ। দুর্গাপুজোয় ২ দিন বঙ্গে থাকবেন কেন্দ্রীয় স্বরাষ্ট্রমন্ত্রী। ১৭ অক্টোবর কলকাতায় আসছেন শাহ। বেলুড় মঠ, শোভাবাজার রাজবাড়িতে যেতে পারেন অমিত শাহ। চেতলা, শ্রীভূমি-সহ কয়েকটি পুজো মণ্ডপ পরিদর্শনের সম্ভাবনা\n\n 🔴 প্রতি ঘণ্টা, প্রতি  মিনিট, প্রতি https://t.co/XC5DcckJR1","url":"https://x.com/BanglaRepublic/status/2109922753038229810"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2109916771658735616"]},"author_id":"729184449997484032","created_at":"2026-10-13T08:02:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109917786063663573"],"id":"2109917786063663573","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":2995,"like_count":49,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":11},"text":"'টালা প্রত্যয়' নয়, নাম হওয়া উচিত 'টাকা প্রত্যয়'\nবাণিজ্যেই বসতে লক্ষ্মী, আর মণ্ডপে এখন 'পেইড' দুর্গা!' ঐতিহ্য সংস্কৃতির  বাংলার পরিবর্তনে ঠাকুর দেখাও এখন নোংরা ব্যবসার স্কিম। \n\nআর কিছু অতি উৎসাহী মানুষ আছে যারা সেই টিকিট কেটে যাচ্ছেও ঠাকুর দেখতে 😊 https://t.co/6dSYV226ZY","url":"https://x.com/barnali_iam/status/2109917786063663573"},{"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-13T08:01:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109917337239556442"],"id":"2109917337239556442","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":308,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Durga Puja is the only public art festival in the world that is shown for free.\n\nSo, if there is a paid preview programme, I fully support it.\n\nHowever, the entire amount should go only to the artist, his team &amp; his labourers; not the club or its members. https://t.co/5DJCa1fEOa","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109917337239556442"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109912971313106944"]},"author_id":"1360821125152874500","created_at":"2026-10-13T07:43:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109912981446561810"],"id":"2109912981446561810","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":328,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":2},"text":"Union home minister Amit Shah to visit #Kolkata from October 17-18 in connection with Durga Puja #festival. \n\nHM #AmitShah likely to visit Belur Math, Deshbandhu Club at Bally in Howrah, 24 Pally, Chetla, Kolkata, Sovabazar Rajbari, Kolkata and Sreebhumi in Lake Town. https://t.co/bGvEDE5Jw8","url":"https://x.com/Journo_Rajesh/status/2109912981446561810"},{"author_id":"3868003454","created_at":"2026-10-13T07:43:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109912846398271869"],"id":"2109912846398271869","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":23,"impression_count":1644,"like_count":50,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":5},"text":"So there are some 3000 pandals in the city. Covering all of them won't be possible or practical. If you want to do just the big and famous one, even that would be some 200 pandals and on Ashtami/Navami visiting just one of them can eat up 5-6 hours. \n\nSo this needs planning. https://t.co/KYHxFmIMLJ","url":"https://x.com/EducatedMoron/status/2109912846398271869"},{"author_id":"1341576373672898561","created_at":"2026-10-13T07:40:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109912079058563085"],"id":"2109912079058563085","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":32,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@Smon1992 Haa bikel 4pm last","url":"https://x.com/SudhanidhiB/status/2109912079058563085"},{"author_id":"1652663256144805889","created_at":"2026-10-13T07:35:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109910804661493842"],"id":"2109910804661493842","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@BySabya @runkarthikrun Not necessarily , there have been many murtis of Ma that have been massive in size and scale (especially the Deshapriya park pujo which happened a few years back.)","url":"https://x.com/SayantanDe40591/status/2109910804661493842"},{"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-13T07:04:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109903048978100541"],"id":"2109903048978100541","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":880,"like_count":43,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":4},"text":"There is a severe lack of interest by the public in this year's Durga Puja, owing to the veg fear, Sanatan imposition, and so on.\n\nConsequently, the investors are also reluctant despite government's assurance, leading to such empty bamboo scaffolding.\n\nIt is heartbreaking to see. https://t.co/kkvViNJRNA","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109903048978100541"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109901933842747393"]},"author_id":"1341576373672898561","created_at":"2026-10-13T06:59:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109901943539949865"],"id":"2109901943539949865","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":2578,"like_count":388,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":32},"text":"This the Durga that will steal you heart— Ahiritola Sarbojonin. Will be open for Public 15th October (Evening onwards) https://t.co/EYtMJHNMjW","url":"https://x.com/SudhanidhiB/status/2109901943539949865"},{"author_id":"1812128031739396096","created_at":"2026-10-13T06:59:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109901745665237451"],"id":"2109901745665237451","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@Amit4Films Impossible to visit all pandals. One pandal namely Sribhumi near lake town will physically drain you.","url":"https://x.com/lal_chotu16891/status/2109901745665237451"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109895637361983488"]},"author_id":"2075928017327865857","created_at":"2026-10-13T06:35:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109895784175124650"],"id":"2109895784175124650","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"#टीबी_हारेगा_देश_जीतेगा\n\n#JOSH #TBMuktBharat\n#4asaam_bn\n#sribhumi https://t.co/wBcKoBXuWf","url":"https://x.com/Pritomayh/status/2109895784175124650"},{"author_id":"2282463944","created_at":"2026-10-13T06:27:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109893793063538715"],"id":"2109893793063538715","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":12,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@Amit4Films do north one day (dum dum park, nager bazar,sreebhumi, salt lake) , south another day (behala leg needs another day), central kolkata another day…many do overnight pandal hops but it’s 24/7 going forward","url":"https://x.com/bikramjitbiswas/status/2109893793063538715"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2109891987185029120"]},"author_id":"1331224968407891970","created_at":"2026-10-13T06:22:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109892532830384604"],"id":"2109892532830384604","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":132,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"#WatchNow: শ্রীভূমির পুজোয় এবার থাকা হচ্ছে না সুজিতের                                                                                  \n\nসব খবর: https://t.co/zS5Is2Kr34\n\n#SujitBose | #Sreebhumi | #Tv9Bangla | #SreebhumiDurgaPuja | https://t.co/DPT239MfLw","url":"https://x.com/Tv9_Bangla/status/2109892532830384604"},{"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-13T05:33:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109880255108301277"],"id":"2109880255108301277","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":373,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"I see that a lot of people ask me about Durga Puja in the replies.\n\nIf you've any queries about routes, DM me.\n\nAnd if you want to visit any particular pandal, Google Maps is your best friend. It'll never disappoint you.","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109880255108301277"},{"author_id":"1936372555","created_at":"2026-10-13T05:06:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109873398621040757"],"id":"2109873398621040757","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":20,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"\"